1
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:03,866
We need to talk

2
00:00:04,233 --> 00:00:05,066
About the project

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,300
Go find the Su Group and the bank

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,766
It's not about the project Ming Yao

5
00:00:08,466 --> 00:00:09,500
It's about 15 years ago

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,900
Why did you never tell me

7
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,600
Tell you what

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,433
That you helped him

9
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:14,666
Gu Chengze do you think

10
00:00:14,866 --> 00:00:15,866
If I told you earlier

11
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:17,000
That he might be connected to the Fu family

12
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,100
You would have made a different choice

13
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,400
Don't tell me you chose Fu Chenzhou

14
00:00:20,033 --> 00:00:21,233
Without considering the benefits

15
00:00:22,566 --> 00:00:23,366
Mr Gu

16
00:00:24,033 --> 00:00:25,100
When she chose me

17
00:00:25,266 --> 00:00:26,966
I was just the bodyguard you mentioned

18
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,300
She knew the past

19
00:00:28,433 --> 00:00:30,000
But didn't use it to tie me down

20
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,666
She knew the Fu family was investigating

21
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,100
But didn't use them to force me

22
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,366
A choice you couldn't make

23
00:00:34,466 --> 00:00:35,700
Doesn't mean she can't

24
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,366
Please leave Mr Gu

25
00:00:38,266 --> 00:00:40,900
Fu Chenzhou you haven't returned to the Fu family yet

26
00:00:41,033 --> 00:00:42,466
Do you really think you've won

27
00:00:42,466 --> 00:00:43,200
Whether I have won or not

28
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,433
Is not up to the Fu family

29
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:46,466
When she stood by my side

30
00:00:46,566 --> 00:00:47,966
I had already won once

31
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,500
Were you serious about what you just said

32
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:58,700
Which part

33
00:00:59,466 --> 00:01:00,000
Me standing by your side
